      "content": "it's just hard to see the logic in the \"struggle\" when you put it like that. if the universe is just a machine tending toward zero, then maybe wanting to exist is actually something that goes against the natural order. it feels like my existence is just unnecessary noise in the system. do you really think it's more rational to just... stop? like, to just step out of the equation entirely?",
